+- id: 2026.06.372
+  title: 'THE DEEP-THINK PIVOT: build the SEARCH/HEURISTIC layer the planning wall demands. The session''s 5x-adversarial
+    evidence + the 2026-06-10 Deep Think round converged: the selection-verifier moat has inverted (every smart selector flatlines;
+    the lift is generator-attributable), and a verifier gives VALIDITY not directional gradient -- so it cannot crack the
+    L4/Sokoban planning wall alone. The verifier''s principled home is as the SIMULATOR/ENVIRONMENT; the unsolved layer is
+    a SEPARATE goal-induction + heuristic-search NAVIGATOR. This milestone builds it: induce the GOAL PREDICATE separately
+    from the dynamics rule (exp4020), then run heuristic search over the induced+verified world model to break a planning
+    wall single-step re-induction stalled on (exp4021, the central bet -- which also tests whether the wall is SEARCH vs REPRESENTATION,
+    our vc33 99%-WM data says search). Decentralization is DATA-GATED on exp4012 (exp4022, branch on the actual best-of-N
+    number, not Deep Think''s confidence). DEMOTE the dead selection line: retire the agreement-as-selector claim, keep the
+    shipped safety gate (exp4023). KEEP the proven tracks: 5th-game first-solve (exp4024), ArcMemo transfer (exp4025). Capstone:
+    did adding a search/heuristic layer over the verified world model advance ARC-3 accuracy past the planning wall (exp4028).'
+  doc: docs/research-notes/deep-think-results-2026-06-10.md
+  completed: '2026-06-11'
+  finding: See conductor log for per-experiment results.
+  tasks:
+  - id: exp4019-archive-v371-activate-v372
+    title: 'Archive .371 -> activate .372; KEEP the hardened green-gate + poison-test quarantine (held through .370/.371).
+      Assert research-complete.yaml + ops/exclusion_manifest.yaml parse under yaml.safe_load and the ARC agentic modules import,
+      run the smart-subset pre-test gate green, then RECORD the .371 close-state truth (the GAP-4 phase: which follow-ups
+      executed vs hit the wall-clock cap; exp4012 decentralization result if landed; ARC-3 games/levels).'
+    deliverable: results/experiment_4019_archive_v371_activate_v372.json
+    result: OK (conductor)
+  - id: exp4020-goal-induction-separation
+    title: 'GOAL-INDUCTION SEPARATION (the planning-layer prerequisite Deep Think Q2 named): on an ARC-AGI-3 game where we
+      ALREADY have a verifier-certified world model (r11l L1-L3, or vc33 at 99% dynamics accuracy), induce the GOAL PREDICATE
+      -- the function over a state that returns solved/not-solved -- SEPARATELY from the dynamics rule, from the OBSERVED
+      level-up transitions (the frame just before a level_completed signal). The dynamics model (T(s,a)->s'') and the goal
+      predicate (is_goal(s)) are DIFFERENT objects; this milestone treats them separately because a verifier gives validity,
+      not direction -- the goal predicate is half of the missing navigator.'
+    deliverable: results/experiment_4020_goal_induction_separation.json
+    result: OK (conductor)
+  - id: exp4021-heuristic-search-over-verified-wm
+    title: 'HEURISTIC SEARCH OVER THE VERIFIED WORLD MODEL (THE CENTRAL BET of the Deep-Think pivot): implement a planning
+      search -- bounded best-first / A* / depth-limited MCTS -- over the induced+verifier-certified world model from exp4020,
+      with the VERIFIER as the forward simulator (legal next-state expansion + the exp4020 goal test) and a heuristic value
+      (distance-to-goal proxy: cells-to-goal, progress-bar delta, object-alignment, or a learned/coded heuristic) providing
+      the directional gradient the verifier cannot. TARGET: break a planning wall that single-step re-induce->validate->act
+      STALLED on (r11l L4, or vc33 -- where a 99%-accurate verified WM still failed to solve). This is the direct test of
+      Deep Think Q2 (dynamics != heuristics: does adding a SEPARATE navigator over the verified simulator advance past the
+      wall?) AND of the modality-mismatch steelman (if search over the code-represented WM SOLVES it, the wall was SEARCH
+      not representation -- which our vc33 99%-WM data predicts).'
+    deliverable: results/experiment_4021_heuristic_search_over_verified_wm.json
+    result: OK (conductor)
+  - id: exp4022-decentralization-gated-on-exp4012
+    title: 'DECENTRALIZATION next step, DATA-GATED on exp4012''s actual best-of-N result (Deep Think confidently claimed best-of-N
+      is hopeless; exp4012 measured it -- read the number, then branch). IF exp4012 showed local best-of-N (k=8-16, gemma-4-12B)
+      BEAT vote / materially lifted induction: run a SCALING confirmation (higher k, or a second local model) -- the sovereign
+      path is viable. IF it did NOT (Deep Think''s structural-representational-deficit right -- best-of-N yields confident
+      failures): prototype the VERIFIER-AS-REWARD distillation FEASIBILITY (the alternative sovereignty path): collect N verifier-certified
+      (demo-perfect, execution-validated) induction traces from the codex+verifier stack as a fine-tune corpus, and measure
+      the feasibility (corpus size achievable, trace quality, a SMALL fine-tune sanity check on a tiny subset) -- a FEASIBILITY
+      scoping, NOT a full multi-hour distillation train.'
+    deliverable: results/experiment_4022_decentralization_gated.json
+    result: OK (conductor)
+  - id: exp4023-retire-agreement-selector
+    title: 'RETIRE the agreement-as-selector claim (the Deep-Think ''demote selection R&D'' directive + the pending retire_if_same_verdict):
