+      \ even though it is not a smart selector. Confirm/extend .371's exp4013 if it landed; otherwise run fresh."
+    deliverable: results/experiment_4026_verifier_vs_judge_efficiency.json
+    result: OK (conductor)
+  - id: exp4027-hardware-continuity
